axiomatizability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0e6c8c75d056b765\" href=\"?note=0e6c8c75d056b765\" title=\"67-df-compositional-partial-truth\">67-df-compositional-partial-truth</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"53–54"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"64–65"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述和原书证明结构已核对；Lemma 4.1 的全部算术化细节未独立形式验证"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是一致原始递归公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\\)</span>，采用同一标准证明算术化和部分真接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{URefl}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{URefl}(S)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4837cec0530b35f0\" href=\"?note=4837cec0530b35f0\" title=\"67-df-uniform-reflection\">67-df-uniform-reflection</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bounded}(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bounded}(X)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fea02b696529d019\" href=\"?note=fea02b696529d019\" title=\"67-df-bounded-axiomatizability\">67-df-bounded-axiomatizability</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 可为非递归可枚举句子集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 是固定矛盾句；所有理论扩张关系以下面可推导每个公理表达。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>部分真参数取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0e6c8c75d056b765\" href=\"?note=0e6c8c75d056b765\" title=\"67-df-compositional-partial-truth\">67-df-compositional-partial-truth</a> 的同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,c,r,b\">\\(U,c,r,b\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPT}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{CPT}(U)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hierarchy}(c,r,b)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hierarchy}(c,r,b)\\)</span>；所有公式类使用该接口的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\gamma\">\\(D,\\gamma\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Bigl(\\forall\\rho\\in\\mathrm{URefl}(S)\\ T\\vdash\\rho\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Bounded}(X)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\theta\\in T\\ S\\cup X\\vdash\\theta\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow S\\cup X\\vdash\\bot\\Bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Bigl(\\forall\\rho\\in\\mathrm{URefl}(S)\\ T\\vdash\\rho\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Bounded}(X)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\theta\\in T\\ S\\cup X\\vdash\\theta\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow S\\cup X\\vdash\\bot\\Bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 Theorem 4.2；强点在于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 不必可枚举。原书把在一个真实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 句帮助下的可证性编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pr}_{S,\\Gamma}\">\\(\\mathrm{Pr}_{S,\\Gamma}\\)</span>，由 uniform reflection 得其反思，再取自否定固定点产生矛盾。</p>\n<p>陈述、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的范围以及依赖 Lemma 4.1 的路径已核对。未独立重建真实句子参数的证明谓词及部分真组合性质，故不将其登记为本次完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-uniform-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"4837cec0530b35f0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-uniform-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-bounded-axiomatizability","status":"resolved","id":"fea02b696529d019","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-bounded-axiomatizability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-compositional-partial-truth","status":"resolved","id":"0e6c8c75d056b765","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-compositional-partial-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-uniform-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"4837cec0530b35f0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{URefl}(S)$ 取 [[67-df-uniform-reflection]]；$\\mathrm{Bounded}(X)$ 取 [[67-df-bounded-axiomatizability]]。$X$ 可为非递归可枚举句子集。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-bounded-axiomatizability","status":"resolved","id":"fea02b696529d019","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{URefl}(S)$ 取 [[67-df-uniform-reflection]]；$\\mathrm{Bounded}(X)$ 取 [[67-df-bounded-axiomatizability]]。$X$ 可为非递归可枚举句子集。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-compositional-partial-truth","status":"resolved","id":"0e6c8c75d056b765","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"部分真参数取 [[67-df-compositional-partial-truth]] 的同一个 $U,c,r,b$，满足 $\\mathrm{CPT}(U)$、$\\mathrm{Hierarchy}(c,r,b)$；所有公式类使用该接口的 $D,\\gamma$。